<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>Incheon China Town</name>
<description><![CDATA[Three short walks in Incheon's open-port quarter, 2 minutes from Incheon Station (line 1): the China Town main street, the Songwol-dong Fairy Tale Village loop and the Japanese-style street, plus the two mural streets and the Incheon Citizens' House.]]></description>
