<Placemark><name>China Town main street: 1st Paeru → Chinatown-ro → 3rd Paeru, 0.3 km</name><description><![CDATA[0.3 km<br>1. Chinatown-ro via the 1st gate, Uiseondang and Gonghwachun (pedestrian router on OSM streets)]]></description><styleUrl>#line-0</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>126.617510,37.475606,0 126.617937,37.475589,0 126.618643,37.475535,0 126.619517,37.475506,0 126.619495,37.475486,0 126.619495,37.475486,0 126.619517,37.475506,0 126.619601,37.475609,0 126.619614,37.475750,0 126.619778,37.475752,0 126.620437,37.475756,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
